# Domain Model

- Use Task + Assignment + ExecutionAttempt + Command + Event. Do not collapse into a single status field.
- Task terminal states (SUCCEEDED/FAILED/CANCELED) must not return to RUNNING; recovery creates a new attempt/task.
- Robot state is multi-dimensional: connectivity, operational, mission, battery, localization, safety, maintenance.
- Task status is not Robot status. Offline robots do not auto-fail tasks without policy.
- One active assignment per task; one primary lease per robot.
